{"id":"me_todo","lemma":"método","pos":"noun","rank":2698,"glosses":["method (a process by which a task is completed; a way of doing something)"],"ipa":"/ˈmetodo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"métodos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-m%C3%A9todo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Por qué es mejor tu método?","en":"Why is your method better?","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"better"},{"g":"your"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why, for what reason"]]},{"text":"Tu método es diferente del mío.","en":"Your method is different from mine.","words":[{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"differently"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"mine"}]},{"text":"Aprendemos por el método prueba-error.","en":"We learn by trial and error.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/805864","words":[{"g":"to learn","l":"aprender"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"proof"},{"g":"error"}]},{"text":"Nuestra escuela adoptó sus métodos de enseñanza.","en":"Our school adopted his teaching methods.","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"to adopt","l":"adoptar"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"teaching"}]},{"text":"¿Qué método usaste para dejar de fumar?","en":"What method did you use to give up smoking?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506560","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to use","l":"usar"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to leave"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to smoke"}]}]}